                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi yule jamaa aliyekuwa wa karibu akasema, Mimi sitaweza kulikomboa kwa nafsi yangu, nisije nikauharibu urithi wangu mwenyewe; basi haki yangu ya kulikomboa ujichukulie wewe, maana mimi sitaweza kulikomboa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.6"
            ]
