        },
        {
          "text": "Nao wale wanawake waliokuwa jirani zake wakampa jina, wakisema, Naomi amezaliwa mwana; wakamwita jina lake Obedi; yeye ndiye baba yake Yese, aliye baba yake Daudi.",
